WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.110 --> 00:00:03.040
Hey North Carolina, Conan
O'Brien here reminding you

00:00:03.040 --> 00:00:06.090
to register to vote and
make your voice heard.

00:00:06.090 --> 00:00:08.660
The last time North Carolina
citizens didn't vote,

00:00:08.660 --> 00:00:11.200
you got the Winston-Salem building.

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:12.033
You wanna get that?

00:00:12.033 --> 00:00:14.900
You wanna get Winston-Salem'd this year?

00:00:14.900 --> 00:00:16.190
I don't think so.

00:00:16.190 --> 00:00:17.710
So why not make a day of it?

00:00:17.710 --> 00:00:19.670
Pop on over to Harris Teeter,

00:00:19.670 --> 00:00:22.790
pick up some cheer wine and
vinegar for a pig pickin',

00:00:22.790 --> 00:00:26.930
and wash it all down
with registering to vote.

00:00:26.930 --> 00:00:28.640
Don't let democracy crash and burn

00:00:28.640 --> 00:00:30.670
like the Wright brothers'
failed flight attempt

00:00:30.670 --> 00:00:33.010
at Kitty Hawk in 1903.

00:00:33.010 --> 00:00:37.680
Orville walked with a limp the
rest of his life, poor guy.

00:00:37.680 --> 00:00:39.821
So North Carolina, remember, October 9th

